coverage.*

# Copier
.copier-answers.yml

# Environment
.env
.env.bak.*
.envrc
.direnv/

# Build output
bin/
dist/

# Everything otelc generates is a build artifact, not source. `otelc go build`
# writes these, builds, then reverts — so a clean checkout has none of them and
# an interrupted build is the only reason they linger. Matches upstream's own
# .gitignore. go.mod carries no otelc requires or replace directives; otelc adds
# them per build and takes them back out.
.otelc-build/
.otelc-build.lock
cmd/*/otelc.runtime.go
otel.instrumentation.go


